  (text "J10 — SWD DEBUG HEADER (4-pin 2.54mm)" (at 45.0 38.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Pin 1: SWDIO (PA13 AF0)\nPin 2: SWDCLK (PA14 AF0)\nPin 3: GND\nPin 4: +3.3V (optional - powers target from programmer)" (at 95.0 43.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "Connect ST-Link V2/V3. PA13/PA14 default to SWD after reset.\nFull hardware debug: breakpoints, live variable watch.\nUse debug.sh script: starts OpenOCD + GDB at main()." (at 95.0 51.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "J11 — UART DEBUG / BOOTLOADER (3-pin 2.54mm)" (at 45.0 68.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Pin 1: TX (PA9 USART1 AF1) -> RX of USB-UART adapter\nPin 2: RX (PA10 USART1 AF1) -> TX of USB-UART adapter\nPin 3: GND\n115200 8N1, 3.3V logic level. Do NOT connect 5V directly." (at 95.0 73.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "Telemetry: tick,state,mode,white_mv,black_mv,brake_ccr,\n           ka_ccr,pot_raw,ramp_ms,brake_active,latvian_active\nCommands: SET BRAKE_ENTER/EXIT/SOFT, SET KA_MAX,\n          SET LATVIAN_DVDT, SAVE, GET, HELP" (at 95.0 83.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "J12 — BOOT0 BUTTON (2-pin 2.54mm)" (at 45.0 98.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Momentary button pulls PA14-BOOT0 to 3.3V via 10k (add series R to coexist with SWCLK).\nG0: BOOT0 is the PA14 pin, NOT PB8; requires option bit nBOOT_SEL=0.\nHold J12 + press J13 = ROM UART bootloader entry on PA9/PA10.\nFlash: stm32flash -w aart_brake.bin /dev/ttyUSB0\nBOOT0 documents to PA14 (via series R, shares SWCLK); PB8 reassigned to TM1637 display DIO." (at 85.0 100.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "J13 — NRST BUTTON (2-pin 2.54mm)" (at 45.0 120.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Momentary button pulls NRST to GND.\nPress while holding J12 BOOT0 to enter bootloader.\nRelease J13 first, then release J12." (at 85.0 123.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))


  (text "USB-C INTERFACE (J_USB + U3 CH340N):\n\nJ_USB (USB-C 16-pin, HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12):\n  VBUS (A4/B4) -> F_USB (500mA polyfuse) -> D_USB (BAT54 anode)\n  D_USB cathode -> LDO input (ORs with WHITE rail path)\n  D+ (A6/B6) -> U3 pin 3\n  D- (A7/B7) -> U3 pin 4\n  CC1 (A5) -> R_CC1 (5.1k) -> GND\n  CC2 (B5) -> R_CC2 (5.1k) -> GND\n  GND (A1/B1/A12/B12) -> GND\n  SBU1/SBU2/SSRX/SSTX: NC\n\nU3 CH340N SOP-8 (JLCPCB C506813):\n  Pin 1 (V3) -> VCC (short to pin 8, 3.3V mode)\n  Pin 2 (GND) -> GND\n  Pin 3 (D+) -> J_USB D+\n  Pin 4 (D-) -> J_USB D-\n  Pin 5 (RXD) -> MCU PA9 (USART1_TX)\n  Pin 6 (TXD) -> MCU PA10 (USART1_RX)\n  Pin 7 (NC)\n  Pin 8 (VCC) -> 3.3V rail + C_USB2 (100nF)\n\nPOWER PRIORITY:\n  WHITE (12-16V) via D_WHITE and USB VBUS (5V) via D_USB\n  both diode-OR into LDO input.\n  WHITE wins on voltage when track connected.\n  USB-only mode: VBUS powers LDO at 5V, FETs unpowered (WHITE=0V),\n  MCU and UART fully functional for bench configuration." (at 20 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))

